{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44388","headline":"诗三百三首 八十五 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 八十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多少般数人，百计求名利。\n心贪觅荣华，经营图富贵。\n心未片时歇，奔突如烟气。\n家眷实团圆，一呼百诺至。\n不过七十年，冰消瓦解置。\n死了万事休，谁人承後嗣。\n水浸泥弹丸，方知无意智。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}